# React authoring

## File layout

- Component: `{ExportName}.tsx` in manifest subpath directory
- Spec: co-located `{kebab}.spec.tsx`
- Barrel: `index.ts` re-exports component + types
- CE-host lib: `src/lib/custom-element-host.ts` — do not fork per component

## Component rules

- **Named exports only** — `export const BarChart = forwardRef<…>(…)`
- **Always `forwardRef`** to root `HTMLElement` (or CE host)
- Props type: `{ExportName}Props` exported alongside component
- Merge `className` and `style` onto root / CE host
- **`children`** at documented composition point

## CE-host pattern (media, wasm, manual WC)

Use `useCustomElementHost` from `src/lib/custom-element-host.ts`:

- `register` — idempotent WC register function
- `attrs` — camelCase prop → kebab attribute map
- `events` — CE event name → React `onXxx` prop map
- Sync complex props via ref + `setProperty` inside the hook — not in render body

Return `createElement(TAG, { ref: hostRef, className, style })`.

## Native React components

- Match WC BEM markup and `data-testid` from shared template
- Post-codegen enhancements (e.g. axis labels on `BarChart`) — promote to `react-templates.mjs` when parity desired across frameworks
- Charts: `role="img"` + `aria-label` (`13-accessibility.mdc`)

## Controlled state

`open` + `onOpenChange` for accordion/modal/collapsible.

## StrictMode

Effects that register CEs or start Three/ffmpeg must **clean up** on unmount (dispose, revoke URLs) — StrictMode double-invokes effects in dev.

## Interop

React may host WC tags directly; prefer typed wrappers from this package for props/events consistency (`docs/40-react-runtime-integration.md`).

## Must not

- Default-export components from public subpaths
- Import from `@rosettadash/react` root in consumer docs — always subpath imports
- Add framework-only exports without manifest entry (see charter grandfather list)

